<title>USA: Stewart Enterprises to restructure.</title>
<headline>Stewart Enterprises to restructure.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stewart Enterprises Inc said Thursday it would restructure its operations in North America beginning February 1.  </p>
<p>Stewart said it would expand its funeral home and cemetery operating divisions from two to four.</p>
<p>The new Western Division will includes 77 funeral homes and five cemeteries in Canada, and 28 funeral homes and four cemeteries on the West Coast in California and Oregon, previously part of the Central Division.</p>
<p>The new Southern Division will include 55 funeral homes and 22 cemeteries in Florida, Puerto Rico and Mexico, previously part of the Eastern Division.</p>
</text>
